WEBVTT

01:49.450 --> 01:54.950
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.080 --> 01:57.900
[Episode 31]

01:59.280 --> 02:00.070
Nan Heng!

02:01.430 --> 02:02.230
Nan Heng!

02:13.470 --> 02:14.280
It's...

02:14.690 --> 02:15.560
Snowing?

02:17.630 --> 02:18.560
Goose feathers.

02:27.910 --> 02:28.829
Lotus flowers.

02:37.040 --> 02:40.860
[Official Land Deed Document]

02:40.150 --> 02:40.990
Land deed.

02:57.710 --> 02:58.630
This is

03:00.910 --> 03:02.370
a dog that looks like a cat,

03:03.470 --> 03:04.930
and a cat that looks like a dog.

03:04.930 --> 03:07.020
I want

03:07.190 --> 03:08.530
a dog that looks like a cat,

03:08.530 --> 03:09.780
a cat that looks like a dog,

03:09.780 --> 03:11.310
and a Heavenly Horse that can fly.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.630
I also want a big house,

03:12.630 --> 03:13.590
with cedars to admire in summer,

03:13.590 --> 03:14.520
lotuses in winter,

03:14.520 --> 03:15.840
and a life without work all year round.

03:15.840 --> 03:16.840
No endless PPTs,

03:16.840 --> 03:17.870
no mental manipulation,

03:17.870 --> 03:19.220
no self-important guys on the street,

03:19.220 --> 03:20.360
and no keyboard warriors online.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.360
As for the person I like,

03:21.360 --> 03:22.520
he should be sweet and cuddly
like a puppy by day,

03:22.520 --> 03:23.400
but fierce and wild like a little wolf
by night.

03:23.400 --> 03:24.190
And in his spare time,

03:24.190 --> 03:27.190
he needs to help me walk that dog
which looks like a cat.

04:12.730 --> 04:15.160
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

04:16.910 --> 04:18.720
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

04:20.510 --> 04:23.350
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

04:24.440 --> 04:27.150
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

04:28.160 --> 04:30.860
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

04:32.470 --> 04:33.360
According to the Classic of
Mountains and Seas,

04:32.620 --> 04:34.590
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

04:34.159 --> 04:36.000
two hundred li northeast of Mount Bei,

04:36.000 --> 04:38.270
there dwells a beast shaped like
a white dog with a black head.

04:36.500 --> 04:39.220
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

04:38.360 --> 04:40.040
Upon seeing humans, it takes flight.

04:40.040 --> 04:41.120
It's known as the Heavenly Horse.

04:40.290 --> 04:42.920
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

04:41.950 --> 04:43.190
Although I don't know

04:43.190 --> 04:45.040
what the Heavenly Horse looks like,

04:45.040 --> 04:45.950
this one

04:45.620 --> 04:52.620
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

04:47.560 --> 04:49.630
is the closest one I could find.

04:50.159 --> 04:51.340
You also said

04:51.750 --> 04:53.680
you want to not work all year round,

04:53.690 --> 05:00.470
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

04:53.870 --> 04:55.010
with no endless PPTs

04:55.360 --> 04:56.760
or mental manipulation.

04:58.070 --> 04:59.040
Although I don't know

04:59.040 --> 05:01.160
what PPT and mental manipulation are,

05:01.160 --> 05:02.500
I do understand the word "work"

05:01.350 --> 05:08.220
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

05:02.830 --> 05:04.190
to some extent.

05:05.310 --> 05:06.830
Mr. Song said that since childhood,

05:06.830 --> 05:08.630
you've never liked needlework.

05:08.630 --> 05:09.780
So when we're together,

05:09.440 --> 05:19.100
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

05:09.800 --> 05:11.660
you naturally won't have to do it.

05:13.120 --> 05:13.870
Also,

05:15.120 --> 05:16.780
I want you to have the land deed

05:17.070 --> 05:18.360
for Waning River Crescent,

05:18.360 --> 05:20.110
as well as my salary.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.510
You can buy whatever you want,

05:21.510 --> 05:23.070
and do whatever you want.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.630
I won't let anyone

05:25.070 --> 05:26.070
mistreat you.

05:28.630 --> 05:29.700
As for

05:30.190 --> 05:31.310
self-important guys

05:31.310 --> 05:32.640
and keyboard warriors,

05:33.240 --> 05:34.700
I know nothing about them.

05:35.310 --> 05:37.159
About being like a sweet puppy or
a fierce wolf,

05:37.159 --> 05:38.890
I'm also completely clueless.

05:39.600 --> 05:41.720
Although you always say things
that I don't understand

05:41.720 --> 05:42.620
and you always have
concerns and thoughts

05:42.620 --> 05:44.540
I can't figure out in your heart,

05:45.480 --> 05:46.680
no matter what,

05:48.710 --> 05:50.240
I want to protect you for a lifetime.

05:49.240 --> 05:56.050
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

05:55.630 --> 05:56.430
So,

05:57.320 --> 06:06.820
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

06:01.560 --> 06:03.290
will you give me another chance

06:04.040 --> 06:05.040
and marry me?

06:23.120 --> 06:23.920
No.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.040
I know

06:30.620 --> 06:32.080
everything you’ve done is

06:33.190 --> 06:34.430
exactly what I want,

06:35.920 --> 06:36.900
but Nan Heng,

06:38.720 --> 06:41.180
please don't do these things for me
anymore.

06:45.070 --> 06:46.159
Why not?

06:49.950 --> 06:51.810
Because I really can't marry you.

06:55.390 --> 06:56.680
I really can't!

06:57.720 --> 06:58.560
Song Yimeng!

07:01.780 --> 07:03.910
-What's going on?
-What's this about?

07:05.210 --> 07:06.010
Song Yimeng.

07:06.920 --> 07:07.930
Song Yimeng.

07:08.110 --> 07:09.770
Why won't you marry me?

07:09.820 --> 07:11.480
Please stop asking, will you?

07:11.560 --> 07:12.390
No, wait.

07:12.550 --> 07:13.570
Song Yimeng,

07:13.630 --> 07:14.430
what's the real reason?

07:14.430 --> 07:15.630
Can't you tell me?

07:20.190 --> 07:21.000
Fine.

07:23.270 --> 07:25.530
Since you're so eager to know the reason,

07:26.390 --> 07:27.720
I'll tell you today.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.820
How could this be?

07:34.100 --> 07:35.730
Everything has been done perfectly.

07:35.730 --> 07:37.790
Don't women like these things?

07:37.820 --> 07:39.870
Could she not be a woman?

07:47.380 --> 07:55.350
[Slacker Escape Plan]

07:56.240 --> 07:57.610
Don't you want to know

07:57.800 --> 07:59.040
why I have to leave and

07:59.870 --> 08:01.560
why I can't be with you?

08:03.720 --> 08:04.850
This is the answer.

08:09.800 --> 08:13.370
[Slacker Escape Plan]

08:14.360 --> 08:15.390
What is this?

08:16.360 --> 08:17.430
These

08:17.920 --> 08:20.050
are all iconic scenes from the script.

08:20.570 --> 08:21.650
I've told you

08:22.320 --> 08:24.950
this is a world inside a storybook.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.630
All the stories written in storybook

08:27.630 --> 08:28.750
will happen.

08:29.650 --> 08:31.100
In this world,

08:31.800 --> 08:33.500
everyone's birth

08:34.320 --> 08:36.650
is part of a storybook written in advance,

08:37.200 --> 08:38.520
one that ultimately

08:38.600 --> 08:39.750
leads to an ending

08:40.909 --> 08:43.169
you can never change.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.530
So the storybook

08:46.440 --> 08:47.900
is the script you spoke of?

08:53.360 --> 08:54.750
How is that possible?

08:55.320 --> 08:56.430
You mean

08:56.750 --> 08:58.630
the world we are in now

08:59.240 --> 09:00.370
is just a storybook?

09:03.600 --> 09:05.510
But you and I are both living people.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.500
Why won't you trust me?

09:07.910 --> 09:08.820
Think about it,

09:09.240 --> 09:10.800
why was I able to see through

09:10.910 --> 09:13.040
all your secrets the moment I got here?

09:14.060 --> 09:15.250
The method of weapon forging!

09:15.250 --> 09:17.100
Am I right, Your Highness?

09:17.150 --> 09:19.080
Why did I already know there would be

09:19.080 --> 09:20.550
a great fire during the Lantern Festival?

09:20.550 --> 09:21.880
And the Zijin Pavilion.

09:22.080 --> 09:24.810
It's all because I had read the script
in advance.

09:25.630 --> 09:26.960
Whenever I'm in danger,

09:26.960 --> 09:29.090
you'd come to save me uncontrollably.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.110
Whenever the plot is changed,

09:31.410 --> 09:31.910
[Ultimate Emptiness, Profound Tranquility]

09:33.210 --> 09:34.550
the sound of typing

09:34.630 --> 09:36.000
would echo in our minds

09:36.000 --> 09:37.860
for no reason at all, wouldn't it?

09:38.470 --> 09:41.010
In the end, the story inevitably
returns to the main plot.

09:41.010 --> 09:42.850
Think about it carefully, Nan Heng.

09:42.850 --> 09:44.380
Isn't it exactly like that?

09:47.240 --> 09:48.180
That day,

09:49.200 --> 09:50.440
you controlled me.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.120
You were controlled too...

09:52.120 --> 09:53.380
It seems that no matter

09:53.640 --> 09:55.380
what danger Song Yimeng is in

09:56.020 --> 09:57.430
or where I am,

09:58.260 --> 10:00.900
my body just moves uncontrollably
to save her.

10:03.710 --> 10:06.030
So in the end, Song Yimeng's warning

10:06.030 --> 10:07.890
about the chaos last night
actually came true.

10:07.890 --> 10:09.750
Don't you find it a bit suspicious?

10:09.750 --> 10:11.750
Because it's written in the script.

10:13.870 --> 10:15.030
The script again.

10:15.120 --> 10:16.180
He's the male lead.

10:16.230 --> 10:17.560
He can escape from death

10:17.590 --> 10:18.840
and turn misfortune into fortune.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.080
He has a cheat code.

10:20.150 --> 10:21.460
Jump down with me.

10:21.720 --> 10:23.200
Are you crazy? We'll die if we jump!

10:23.200 --> 10:24.510
Just trust me this once.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.790
Jumping off a cliff in this world

10:25.790 --> 10:26.890
definitely won't kill us.

10:26.890 --> 10:28.750
Yeah right, like I'd trust you...

10:30.090 --> 10:31.360
Darn it!

10:31.360 --> 10:33.280
Why is it so high?

10:36.470 --> 10:37.280
So

10:39.810 --> 10:42.140
I'm the main character of this storybook,

10:43.910 --> 10:44.720
and you...

10:44.960 --> 10:45.760
That's right.

10:47.390 --> 10:48.680
I'm the female lead

10:49.600 --> 10:51.860
who got inexplicably dragged
into this.

10:53.150 --> 10:54.610
Just think of me as someone

10:56.910 --> 10:58.270
from another world.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.210
Nan Heng.

11:06.320 --> 11:08.520
I know this is all hard for you to accept,

11:08.570 --> 11:09.950
but this is the truth.

11:12.510 --> 11:14.880
If we keep being together,

11:15.030 --> 11:16.790
not only will you turn me into
a human pig,

11:16.790 --> 11:18.190
but the whole Song family

11:18.200 --> 11:19.790
will be executed.

11:24.430 --> 11:27.460
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

11:30.150 --> 11:32.280
So you're distancing yourself from me

11:32.840 --> 11:34.170
and trying to leave here

11:34.870 --> 11:37.330
because you want to protect
the Song family?

11:50.240 --> 11:51.150
Song Yimeng.

11:52.670 --> 11:54.600
Although I don't fully understand

11:54.960 --> 11:57.020
everything you're saying right now,

11:58.200 --> 11:59.240
I hope you

12:00.510 --> 12:01.710
can give me some time.

12:02.550 --> 12:04.210
I'll go figure something out.

12:16.150 --> 12:17.480
But before that,

12:20.960 --> 12:22.090
please don't leave,

12:23.840 --> 12:24.630
okay?

13:08.670 --> 13:10.930
That was a brilliant move.

13:13.550 --> 13:14.620
I've lost.

13:17.870 --> 13:19.070
Your Majesty lost...

13:20.240 --> 13:21.700
I don't think you've lost.

13:22.050 --> 13:24.050
Your skills have improved greatly.

13:25.600 --> 13:26.960
Look more carefully.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.030
I barely won.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.410
Since you've beaten me,

13:38.030 --> 13:40.220
you must agree to a request of mine.

13:42.390 --> 13:44.650
Your Majesty, let's play another round.

13:44.870 --> 13:46.870
Regarding Song Yimeng's marriage,

13:47.150 --> 13:49.000
what are your thoughts now?

13:52.480 --> 13:53.840
You cunning old fox,

13:54.120 --> 13:55.670
cut the sneaky stuff.

13:57.230 --> 13:59.830
She was once betrothed to Chu Guihong,

14:00.150 --> 14:02.880
and has wasted many years waiting
in her chamber.

14:03.290 --> 14:05.510
Now, looking throughout
the entire capital,

14:05.510 --> 14:06.670
besides Heng,

14:07.000 --> 14:08.510
who else could you find

14:08.530 --> 14:10.660
that would be a suitable match for her?

14:12.360 --> 14:13.550
Let me tell you,

14:13.910 --> 14:15.630
this crown prince of mine,

14:16.030 --> 14:16.840
whether it's his scholarly work,

14:16.840 --> 14:17.670
martial skills,

14:17.670 --> 14:18.840
or character,

14:19.030 --> 14:21.080
is exceptional in every way.

14:22.240 --> 14:24.630
What else could you possibly want?

14:26.970 --> 14:27.770
Your Majesty.

14:29.120 --> 14:29.960
My daughter

14:30.510 --> 14:32.220
has a terrible temper

14:33.030 --> 14:36.480
and really isn't fit to be
the future empress.

14:37.970 --> 14:39.930
Her character is indeed flawed.

14:39.960 --> 14:40.840
Exactly.

14:40.840 --> 14:43.080
But she's quite open-minded.

14:44.390 --> 14:46.030
I actually find her

14:46.270 --> 14:47.530
quite admirable now.

14:49.510 --> 14:52.180
Your Majesty, that's not what
you used to think.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.170
What's in the past

14:58.270 --> 15:00.240
need not be mentioned anymore.

15:02.440 --> 15:03.900
The young may be ignorant,

15:04.320 --> 15:06.050
but the old should know better.

15:06.750 --> 15:07.800
The two of them

15:07.910 --> 15:10.240
have stirred up so much trouble together.

15:10.270 --> 15:12.360
They've stormed the palace and

15:12.480 --> 15:14.080
escaped execution,

15:14.630 --> 15:15.690
and they share love

15:16.000 --> 15:17.000
and affection.

15:18.200 --> 15:20.140
Sometimes these young people,

15:20.510 --> 15:22.360
they need us parents

15:22.360 --> 15:23.820
to give them a little push.

15:24.360 --> 15:25.440
Don't you agree?

15:31.500 --> 15:34.690
[Qianyu Mansion]

15:36.000 --> 15:36.790
Jixiang.

15:36.960 --> 15:37.840
When we see Guihong later,

15:37.840 --> 15:39.240
he's bound to be angry with me

15:39.240 --> 15:40.270
over the crown prince issue.

15:40.270 --> 15:41.750
Keep a close eye on him, alright?

15:41.750 --> 15:43.000
I don't mind letting him

15:43.000 --> 15:43.870
blow off some steam.

15:43.870 --> 15:45.000
But if he really goes all out,

15:45.000 --> 15:46.330
you must protect me.

15:46.510 --> 15:47.310
Do you hear me?

15:54.080 --> 15:55.060
My wine!

15:55.200 --> 15:56.350
How could you...

16:01.400 --> 16:02.360
You...

16:12.150 --> 16:13.130
Guihong.

16:13.160 --> 16:14.490
Have you lost your mind?

16:15.080 --> 16:16.910
Nan Heng is the crown prince now.

16:16.910 --> 16:20.040
Trying to assassinate him
would be considered treason!

16:21.360 --> 16:24.220
When did I ever say I wanted
to assassinate Nan Heng?

16:24.680 --> 16:26.380
We've been cousins for over 20 years.

16:26.380 --> 16:27.360
How could I not know

16:27.360 --> 16:28.620
what you're thinking?

16:30.720 --> 16:31.510
Rong Hua.

16:31.840 --> 16:32.630
Rong Hua!

16:34.000 --> 16:35.910
Did you even hear what I said?

16:35.910 --> 16:36.770
Your Highness.

16:37.910 --> 16:39.980
What you stumbled upon tonight
was an accident.

16:39.980 --> 16:41.360
Go home now, get some sleep,

16:41.360 --> 16:43.270
and forget everything that
should be forgotten.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.200
You don't need to worry about anything.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.870
What nonsense are you talking?

16:46.870 --> 16:47.910
How could I stand by and do nothing,

16:47.910 --> 16:49.150
seeing you heading toward death?

16:49.150 --> 16:51.010
If my life really mattered to you,

16:53.930 --> 16:55.590
then why did you go see Nan Heng

16:56.510 --> 16:58.480
before the Three Bureaus'
Joint Interrogation?

16:58.480 --> 16:59.270
I...

16:59.790 --> 17:00.510
I...

17:00.510 --> 17:01.970
I was trying to help you!

17:02.000 --> 17:02.920
I don't need it!

17:06.920 --> 17:09.430
When I returned to the capital in defeat
months ago,

17:09.430 --> 17:10.950
you failed to help me.

17:11.349 --> 17:13.440
When Nan Heng almost forced me
out of the capital,

17:13.440 --> 17:15.569
you still weren't able to do anything.

17:15.589 --> 17:16.680
This so-called help of yours,

17:16.680 --> 17:18.210
were you really helping me,

17:18.270 --> 17:20.329
or were you helping Nan Heng instead?

17:21.410 --> 17:22.109
I... I...

17:22.109 --> 17:23.030
I just wanted to...

17:23.030 --> 17:24.089
No need to explain.

17:24.400 --> 17:26.130
I don't need your help, either.

17:27.109 --> 17:28.400
I don't even care

17:29.720 --> 17:30.960
whose side you're on.

17:34.790 --> 17:35.830
I just want those

17:37.030 --> 17:37.890
who are incapable

17:37.890 --> 17:39.650
to act like it.

17:40.510 --> 17:42.510
Just like before, hiding behind me,

17:43.140 --> 17:45.830
standing off at a distance
with that silly, clueless look.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.090
Is that too much to ask?

17:49.740 --> 17:50.720
I...

17:55.960 --> 17:56.880
Apologize.

18:05.590 --> 18:06.400
Jixiang.

18:07.430 --> 18:08.490
Guihong was right.

18:11.110 --> 18:12.570
Ever since we were little,

18:13.440 --> 18:15.640
he's always been the one protecting me.

18:18.830 --> 18:19.640
Guihong.

18:21.590 --> 18:22.550
I'm sorry

18:23.790 --> 18:25.160
I wasn't able to help you

18:27.160 --> 18:28.690
with what happened before.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.640
But this time,

18:34.240 --> 18:36.900
I really don't want you
to make another mistake.

18:49.830 --> 18:50.960
Forget it, Jixiang.

18:52.970 --> 18:54.050
Let's go.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.400
Come check it out!

19:30.400 --> 19:32.180
Fresh off the cart!

19:33.750 --> 19:35.280
Candied hawthorn skewers!

19:36.130 --> 19:37.520
I've told you

19:38.070 --> 19:40.770
this is a world inside a storybook.

19:42.790 --> 19:44.230
How is that possible?

19:44.750 --> 19:46.750
But you and I are both living people.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.480
Floral print umbrellas!

19:51.480 --> 19:53.310
Floral print umbrellas for sale!

19:53.310 --> 19:55.480
Passing by? Don't miss out!

19:53.880 --> 19:59.820
♪ Without ups and downs, the fireflies
in the dark would mean nothing ♪

19:55.480 --> 19:57.480
All the freshest and best items just in!

19:57.480 --> 19:58.140
No problem.

19:58.640 --> 19:59.650
Fruits!

19:59.680 --> 20:01.550
Fresh fruits!

20:01.420 --> 20:06.480
♪ Never once doubting
the net of fate that traps us both ♪

20:08.090 --> 20:14.130
♪ Someone wrote the story,
and now it's running through our veins ♪

20:16.530 --> 20:18.680
♪ The future hangs by a thread,
caught in the cycle of karma ♪

20:19.980 --> 20:22.430
♪ The signs are always there,
but the ending remains unknown ♪

20:23.710 --> 20:26.370
♪ Everything passes like a flicker—
all just smoke and bubbles ♪

20:27.240 --> 20:32.540
♪ All those wild rumors
somehow feel true, you said ♪

20:33.900 --> 20:43.720
♪ I'm not who I used to be,
just playing a part ♪

20:40.920 --> 20:42.750
Is this world fake?

20:45.200 --> 20:51.340
♪ Eyes dulled, enduring all the scorn ♪

20:52.230 --> 20:55.280
♪ Pages curled, spare me more thorns ♪

20:56.500 --> 20:58.760
♪ I've seen through every illusion ♪

20:59.490 --> 21:05.770
♪ The future is hazy, I wander with
the flow ♪

21:07.050 --> 21:09.930
♪ Why does the pain run deep as
I seek the path back ♪

21:11.070 --> 21:15.170
♪ In a single night, all turns to
hollow sorrow ♪

21:31.830 --> 21:34.080
♪ The plot twists and turns, forcing me
to show weakness ♪

21:35.020 --> 21:37.340
♪ Who takes and who gives, how can we
go with the flow? ♪

21:38.980 --> 21:41.640
♪ Not weak in nature, I write
defiantly against my fate ♪

21:42.550 --> 21:48.360
♪ This unyielding spirit won't be
controlled by someone else's writing ♪

21:49.240 --> 21:58.940
♪ I'd rather be myself,
unwilling to stay silent ♪

22:00.760 --> 22:06.940
♪ Eyes dulled, enduring all the scorn ♪

22:08.400 --> 22:11.150
♪ Pages curled, spare me more thorns ♪

22:12.240 --> 22:14.340
♪ I've seen through every illusion ♪

22:15.260 --> 22:21.250
♪ Strip the paint, let me choose
what's true ♪

22:22.520 --> 22:25.620
♪ If the heart has glimpsed the fire
on the plain ♪

22:24.690 --> 22:26.550
Your Highness, I've finally found you.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.730
Where have you been?

22:26.750 --> 22:30.900
♪ Then let me be the moth again ♪

22:27.920 --> 22:29.380
What exactly happened?

22:31.370 --> 22:32.960
Your Highness, why are you injured?

22:32.960 --> 22:34.460
Say something, will you!

22:38.400 --> 22:39.800
Are you worried about me?

22:39.830 --> 22:40.680
Of course!

22:41.920 --> 22:42.750
Why?

22:43.480 --> 22:45.050
We've grown up together since childhood,

22:45.050 --> 22:46.410
been through life and death together
for so many years,

22:46.410 --> 22:47.400
and you've treated me so well.

22:47.400 --> 22:50.310
If I don't care about you, then who else
would I care about?

22:50.310 --> 22:50.960
Your Highness.

22:50.960 --> 22:53.420
Let's get back first and
talk about it later.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.440
Sit.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.500
Let me ask you,

23:04.510 --> 23:06.030
what if all of this is fake?

23:06.510 --> 23:07.350
Fake?

23:08.720 --> 23:10.050
I mean hypothetically,

23:10.960 --> 23:12.760
if this world we live in

23:13.070 --> 23:14.870
is actually inside a storybook,

23:16.400 --> 23:17.520
what would you do?

23:19.720 --> 23:20.590
In a storybook?

23:22.440 --> 23:23.030
Well...

23:24.240 --> 23:25.980
If we're in a storybook,

23:26.790 --> 23:28.990
is Your Highness's kindness to me real?

23:29.440 --> 23:30.240
It is real.

23:31.270 --> 23:33.510
Can I still eat my fill every day?

23:33.960 --> 23:34.750
Yes.

23:35.070 --> 23:37.270
Can I still have eight steamed buns
at each meal?

23:37.270 --> 23:38.070
You can.

23:38.680 --> 23:40.750
Can I still stay by Your Highness's side,

23:40.750 --> 23:43.480
ranking one level higher than
that Shangguan He?

23:45.550 --> 23:46.730
Of course you can.

23:46.830 --> 23:48.030
Then that settles it.

23:48.880 --> 23:51.280
As long as I can stay by
Your Highness's side

23:51.830 --> 23:53.840
and do what I want to do,

23:53.880 --> 23:56.810
what does it matter
whether I'm in a storybook or not?

24:07.920 --> 24:09.520
Even you can figure this out,

24:10.640 --> 24:12.670
why am I still troubling myself
over nothing?

24:12.670 --> 24:15.070
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

24:14.590 --> 24:16.110
Even if this is a world
inside a storybook,

24:15.940 --> 24:18.370
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

24:17.580 --> 24:19.500
being able to do what I want is enough.

24:19.370 --> 24:22.670
♪ That is the meaning
behind my defiance ♪

24:21.240 --> 24:22.030
So,

24:22.680 --> 24:23.540
Your Highness,

24:24.000 --> 24:25.200
what do you want to do?

24:26.320 --> 24:28.830
♪ Even doomed for eternity,
I still have the courage ♪

24:29.850 --> 24:32.270
♪ For you, I'd step into the uncertainty ♪

24:33.220 --> 24:36.530
♪ If you believe in fate ♪

24:35.960 --> 24:37.560
I want to be the crown prince.

24:38.120 --> 24:40.150
I want to build homes in the Great Jing,

24:38.660 --> 24:40.930
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

24:41.640 --> 24:43.110
bringing prosperity to all the people.

24:41.830 --> 24:44.430
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

24:45.510 --> 24:46.310
I also want to

24:45.610 --> 24:48.820
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

24:47.590 --> 24:49.120
protect those I care about.

24:49.720 --> 24:51.560
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

24:51.910 --> 24:55.490
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

24:55.930 --> 24:57.640
Even if this is a storybook world,

24:56.490 --> 25:00.630
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

24:58.750 --> 24:59.550
I

25:00.960 --> 25:01.790
still want to be

25:01.540 --> 25:04.880
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

25:01.790 --> 25:04.690
the male lead who takes fate
into his own hands.

25:05.700 --> 25:08.500
♪ Then it's not something to grieve over♪

25:28.920 --> 25:29.720
Father.

25:30.790 --> 25:33.480
You knew very well that I didn't want
to marry Nan Heng.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.580
So why did you still accept

25:34.580 --> 25:37.440
the imperial edict for
this marriage arrangement?

25:39.830 --> 25:41.360
The current Seventh Prince

25:41.750 --> 25:43.920
has been officially appointed crown prince
by His Majesty.

25:43.920 --> 25:46.310
He's no longer the Seventh Prince
who was out of favor.

25:46.310 --> 25:47.530
Things have changed.

25:48.750 --> 25:49.510
Father.

25:50.150 --> 25:52.380
Just because Nan Heng is now
the crown prince,

25:52.380 --> 25:54.440
you no longer care about my feelings?

25:57.000 --> 25:59.400
Isn't social climbing

25:59.640 --> 26:02.240
supposed to be Mrs. Song's
character setting?

26:04.720 --> 26:05.750
Song Yimeng.

26:06.000 --> 26:07.390
Let me be honest with you.

26:07.390 --> 26:09.790
His Majesty has given me an ultimatum.

26:10.200 --> 26:11.000
Either

26:11.020 --> 26:13.160
you obediently marry the crown prince
and be his wife,

26:13.160 --> 26:13.920
or

26:14.480 --> 26:16.210
I lose my position as minister.

26:16.960 --> 26:19.090
If you want the whole family to starve,

26:19.750 --> 26:22.920
I'll enter the palace right now
to defy the imperial edict for your sake.

26:22.920 --> 26:23.350
I...

26:28.160 --> 26:29.290
I'll go check on her.

26:32.720 --> 26:34.520
I didn't give myself away, did I?

26:36.890 --> 26:38.420
The crown prince

26:38.440 --> 26:41.810
has really presented me with
a difficult challenge this time.

26:41.810 --> 26:42.870
By the way,

26:43.440 --> 26:44.350
just now

26:44.370 --> 26:46.950
when she accused me of social climbing,

26:47.030 --> 26:47.920
what were you doing?

26:47.920 --> 26:49.320
Why didn't you defend me?

26:52.240 --> 26:53.750
Is that really the point?

26:55.480 --> 26:56.270
Song Yimeng.

26:58.080 --> 26:59.920
[Natural Talent]

26:59.070 --> 27:00.200
Where are you going?

27:02.350 --> 27:04.200
Just going out for some fresh air.

27:04.200 --> 27:05.660
None of you understand me.

27:06.160 --> 27:07.480
I'm going shopping anyway.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.310
Come with me.

27:17.310 --> 27:19.510
Father isn't someone who chases power,

27:19.590 --> 27:21.050
but he's not a fool either.

27:21.590 --> 27:24.190
Everything you've done for
the Seventh Prince

27:24.720 --> 27:26.320
is clear to anyone with eyes.

27:28.510 --> 27:30.830
Saving him doesn't mean I like him.

27:32.110 --> 27:34.000
Even if I do like him, it doesn't mean

27:34.000 --> 27:35.110
I have to marry him.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.560
Keep denying it all you want.

27:39.790 --> 27:41.790
You're just worried that marrying him

27:41.790 --> 27:43.000
might bring

27:43.000 --> 27:44.330
disaster to our family,

27:44.550 --> 27:46.410
causing everyone to be executed.

27:50.120 --> 27:51.300
Song Yiting.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.920
How did you know that?

27:53.480 --> 27:55.140
Nan Heng told Father about it.

27:56.160 --> 27:58.420
Since Father already knows everything,

27:59.870 --> 28:02.000
why is he still helping Nan Heng?

28:03.040 --> 28:05.200
Father has been an official
his whole life,

28:05.200 --> 28:07.150
how could he not understand this?

28:08.310 --> 28:09.910
He's willing to help Nan Heng

28:10.310 --> 28:11.310
all for your sake.

28:13.310 --> 28:14.390
He hopes

28:14.680 --> 28:16.510
you can face your true feelings,

28:18.700 --> 28:20.830
afraid you'll regret it in the future.

28:25.200 --> 28:26.510
But if one day

28:27.750 --> 28:29.410
the Song family were to suffer

28:30.030 --> 28:31.230
because of my choice,

28:33.000 --> 28:34.400
I'd truly regret it.

28:36.350 --> 28:37.430
When you

28:37.510 --> 28:39.400
risked opposing His Majesty,

28:39.440 --> 28:40.750
struck the petition drum,

28:40.750 --> 28:42.810
and desperately protected Nan Heng,

28:42.920 --> 28:44.000
why didn't you think about

28:44.000 --> 28:45.930
implicating the Song family then?

28:48.040 --> 28:49.120
Song Yimeng.

28:49.630 --> 28:51.830
Making excuses to avoid things is easy,

28:52.160 --> 28:54.240
but you can never fool your own heart.

28:58.990 --> 29:02.220
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

29:13.750 --> 29:15.290
The air outside

29:16.070 --> 29:17.400
is indeed quite nice...

29:18.510 --> 29:20.110
The Seven Prince's Mansion?

29:21.750 --> 29:22.620
Song Yiting.

29:23.310 --> 29:25.210
So Nan Heng bought you off too?

29:25.590 --> 29:27.010
Didn't you say

29:27.110 --> 29:29.000
you couldn't stand staying at
the Song Residence for another minute?

29:29.000 --> 29:29.920
This is a perfect chance

29:29.920 --> 29:31.380
to get a change of scenery.

29:32.150 --> 29:33.310
Go by yourself.

29:34.880 --> 29:35.550
Miss Song.

29:35.550 --> 29:36.770
Stop grabbing me.

29:36.790 --> 29:37.840
Let me go!

29:37.880 --> 29:38.670
Song Yiting.

29:38.700 --> 29:39.520
Song Yiting!

29:54.250 --> 29:55.660
You pulled my hair.

29:55.690 --> 29:57.350
Can't you be a little gentler?

29:57.400 --> 29:58.530
I can walk by myself.

30:02.720 --> 30:03.750
Your Highness.

30:05.160 --> 30:06.270
Just a few days apart,

30:06.270 --> 30:08.800
and you've already bought off
my entire family.

30:08.800 --> 30:10.860
That's the solution you came up with?

30:11.400 --> 30:12.680
I don't quite understand

30:12.680 --> 30:14.210
what you're talking about.

30:14.880 --> 30:15.950
However,

30:16.920 --> 30:18.250
since you're here,

30:18.550 --> 30:20.170
why not stay for a few days?

30:20.340 --> 30:21.720
Who wants to stay at your place?

30:21.540 --> 30:23.030
[Drawing from Collective Wisdom]

30:23.240 --> 30:25.440
All the carriages from my residence
have been sent out.

30:25.440 --> 30:26.640
If you want to go home,

30:26.640 --> 30:27.770
you'll have to walk,

30:28.160 --> 30:29.290
and it's quite far.

30:30.590 --> 30:31.640
Nan Heng.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.350
All this is pointless.

30:34.070 --> 30:34.550
I...

30:36.510 --> 30:38.910
I really can't agree to marry you
right now.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.440
Just because you can't now

30:41.440 --> 30:43.350
doesn't mean you won't in the future.

30:43.350 --> 30:44.920
I have all the time in the world,

30:44.920 --> 30:46.250
and I'm willing to wait.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.240
Playing the hopeless romantic?

30:49.310 --> 30:51.210
That kind of act rarely works.

30:53.270 --> 30:54.050
Well,

30:55.510 --> 30:57.260
what kind of character do you like?

30:57.260 --> 30:58.460
I can learn to be that.

30:58.510 --> 30:59.800
No matter what character you adopt now,

30:59.800 --> 31:02.000
it won't change what's going to happen.

31:02.350 --> 31:03.810
I can't get through to you.

31:11.890 --> 31:13.550
I was just about to have lunch.

31:13.720 --> 31:14.700
Why don't you

31:14.750 --> 31:16.610
stay and join me for a simple meal?

31:17.160 --> 31:18.150
No need.

31:18.590 --> 31:19.990
I don't have an appetite.

31:23.880 --> 31:25.070
Please eat something.

31:25.070 --> 31:26.160
I've got it all prepared.

31:26.160 --> 31:27.890
Don't you love hot pot the most?

31:31.000 --> 31:32.460
There's no dipping sauce.

31:32.470 --> 31:33.600
It's not enjoyable.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.520
And without bubble tea,

31:40.550 --> 31:42.550
I can't really enjoy hot pot either.

31:47.510 --> 31:48.350
How about now?

31:49.070 --> 31:50.200
Is it enjoyable now?

31:58.270 --> 32:00.350
It's been so long since I've had hot pot.

32:00.350 --> 32:01.880
I'm absolutely craving it.

32:08.310 --> 32:09.410
In just 10 days,

32:09.510 --> 32:11.160
it will be our wedding day.

32:11.550 --> 32:13.070
During this time, if there's anything
you want to eat,

32:13.070 --> 32:13.750
anything you need,

32:13.750 --> 32:15.070
or anything you want to drink,

32:15.070 --> 32:16.160
just tell Fugui anytime.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.160
Stop right there.

32:17.350 --> 32:18.830
After I finish this hot pot,

32:18.830 --> 32:20.030
I'm going straight home.

32:20.030 --> 32:20.880
My Lady!

32:21.110 --> 32:22.030
We're here!

32:22.360 --> 32:30.650
[Gentle Breeze]

32:23.960 --> 32:25.160
Why are you two here?

32:25.560 --> 32:26.400
We...

32:26.750 --> 32:27.460
Your Highness.

32:27.460 --> 32:28.440
Your Highness.

32:29.310 --> 32:30.810
My Lady, you don't care about us at all,

32:30.810 --> 32:32.260
moving into His Highness's residence

32:32.260 --> 32:33.660
without even telling us.

32:34.550 --> 32:36.400
When did I ever say I was moving in here?

32:36.400 --> 32:37.680
Master told us everything, My Lady.

32:37.680 --> 32:39.850
He said your wedding matters a lot,

32:39.890 --> 32:41.160
and there are many things
you need to discuss,

32:41.160 --> 32:42.640
so you've moved in here first.

32:41.210 --> 32:46.450
[Gentle Breeze]

32:43.240 --> 32:43.590
My Lady.

32:43.590 --> 32:44.510
You'll be family soon anyway.

32:44.510 --> 32:45.790
What's a few days' difference?

32:45.790 --> 32:46.790
Your Highness.

32:46.790 --> 32:48.520
Where is Her Ladyship staying?

32:50.590 --> 32:51.400
Over there.

32:53.470 --> 32:54.880
-Let's go.
-I just don't get it.

32:54.880 --> 32:56.510
Who do you two serve anyway?

33:00.270 --> 33:01.390
My Lady, look.

33:01.580 --> 33:04.110
These hairpins are even more exquisite
than those in the palace.

33:04.110 --> 33:05.080
My Lady, look.

33:05.110 --> 33:07.310
This place looks just like Laiyi House.

33:12.570 --> 33:13.700
I don't want to look.

33:14.770 --> 33:16.880
What's so special about these things?

33:16.880 --> 33:19.540
It's not like our Song family
can't afford them.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.260
My Lady.

33:21.510 --> 33:23.790
Don't you love a life of lounging around
and counting money?

33:23.790 --> 33:24.920
If you marry the Seventh Prince

33:24.920 --> 33:25.920
and become the Crown Princess,

33:25.920 --> 33:27.890
you can live the life you want every day.

33:27.890 --> 33:29.070
That's right, My Lady.

33:29.070 --> 33:29.750
Just think about it.

33:29.750 --> 33:30.850
You like the Seventh Prince,

33:30.850 --> 33:32.060
and he likes you too.

33:32.090 --> 33:34.280
You two make such a perfect match.

33:38.750 --> 33:40.340
If a relationship is doomed

33:40.920 --> 33:42.720
to end badly,

33:43.400 --> 33:45.130
rather than both getting hurt,

33:45.310 --> 33:47.510
maybe it's better not to start it at all.

33:50.640 --> 33:52.880
Our men from Waning River Crescent
asked me to check with you

33:52.880 --> 33:54.400
if there's anything they can do

33:54.400 --> 33:55.920
to help with your wedding.

33:56.290 --> 33:57.790
For example, we could prepare more

33:57.790 --> 33:58.790
celestial cats and dogs and such...

33:58.790 --> 33:59.510
No need.

34:00.030 --> 34:02.090
There's no need to prepare anything.

34:05.590 --> 34:07.790
Actually, I asked Song Yiting about it.

34:07.790 --> 34:09.860
Song Yimeng isn't uninterested in you.

34:09.860 --> 34:12.190
Besides, the imperial edict has set
the wedding date,

34:12.190 --> 34:13.510
and she's already here with you.

34:13.510 --> 34:15.969
Is there really any chance
this will change?

34:16.960 --> 34:18.560
Marriage is a serious matter

34:18.920 --> 34:20.810
that requires mutual affection.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.949
I don't want to force her.

34:23.510 --> 34:25.400
As long as she still has reservations,

34:25.400 --> 34:26.550
I cannot marry her.

34:32.510 --> 34:33.800
I'm afraid your Yimeng

34:33.800 --> 34:35.130
is just like her sister.

34:35.360 --> 34:36.880
Once she's made up her mind,

34:36.880 --> 34:40.139
she's so stubborn that not even
90 oxen could pull her back.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.320
Therefore,

34:43.840 --> 34:46.040
only by completely resolving her fears

34:46.880 --> 34:48.760
can I dispel her concerns.

34:51.170 --> 34:53.860
[Imperial Study]

34:54.360 --> 34:55.710
Crown Prince.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.180
What brings you here today

34:57.180 --> 34:58.330
on purpose?

34:59.650 --> 35:00.500
Your Majesty.

35:00.810 --> 35:03.920
The position of Great Jing's Chancellor
has been vacant for a long time.

35:03.920 --> 35:05.780
I would like to recommend someone

35:06.400 --> 35:07.660
to fill this position.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.640
I wonder

35:10.800 --> 35:14.000
which worthy talent
you wish to recommend, Crown Prince?

35:14.660 --> 35:16.660
The Minister of War, Mr. Song.

35:23.950 --> 35:27.070
Song Yude has always adhered to
the Doctrine of the Mean.

35:27.070 --> 35:28.280
Since entering court,

35:28.280 --> 35:30.440
he has never formed factions
or shown favoritism,

35:30.440 --> 35:33.440
making him the best candidate
for Chancellor indeed.

35:34.370 --> 35:35.460
However,

35:35.880 --> 35:37.680
you've just become Crown Prince

35:37.710 --> 35:40.310
and now want to recommend
your father-in-law.

35:40.440 --> 35:43.040
I'm afraid it'll be hard
to convince the crowd.

35:45.400 --> 35:46.660
Your Majesty is right.

35:46.990 --> 35:49.190
I dare not act out of personal interest.

35:49.880 --> 35:50.880
However,

35:51.670 --> 35:52.890
if this appointment

35:53.000 --> 35:55.330
would cause discontent among officials,

35:55.420 --> 35:56.530
I humbly request Your Majesty

35:56.530 --> 35:57.870
to issue another imperial edict

35:57.870 --> 35:58.880
to check my power.

36:00.030 --> 36:01.490
How would this check work?

36:02.890 --> 36:04.130
If in the future I

36:04.280 --> 36:05.610
should act improperly,

36:06.280 --> 36:08.630
Mr. Song may,
with the support of officials,

36:08.630 --> 36:10.230
have me removed from office.

36:12.170 --> 36:13.330
Nonsense.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.860
If that were the case,

36:15.860 --> 36:17.790
wouldn't our empire change hands?

36:19.510 --> 36:20.320
Your Majesty.

36:21.000 --> 36:22.790
The empire our ancestors established

36:22.790 --> 36:24.850
should be entrusted to worthy hands.

36:24.880 --> 36:26.540
Only then can it be preserved.

36:26.960 --> 36:28.420
With this imperial edict,

36:28.670 --> 36:30.510
Mr. Song can offer frank advice
in the future

36:30.510 --> 36:31.770
without any concerns.

36:31.840 --> 36:32.630
I

36:32.840 --> 36:34.610
will also be diligent in state affairs

36:34.610 --> 36:36.740
and dare not show the slightest slack.

36:46.400 --> 36:47.680
You're doing this

36:48.280 --> 36:51.010
because of Song Yimeng's influence,
aren't you?

36:55.510 --> 36:56.840
I don't believe

36:57.110 --> 36:58.590
that if someone else

36:58.620 --> 37:00.350
were appointed as Chancellor,

37:00.450 --> 37:01.910
you would act the same way.

37:07.710 --> 37:08.970
Your Majesty is right.

37:10.620 --> 37:11.690
I'm also doing this

37:12.440 --> 37:13.970
for the sake of Song Yimeng.

37:15.150 --> 37:16.580
I don't want

37:16.760 --> 37:18.230
Mr. Song to try to please me

37:18.510 --> 37:20.110
because of his daughter in the future,

37:20.110 --> 37:22.030
nor do I want Song Yimeng

37:22.150 --> 37:24.210
to compromise because of her father.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.070
Therefore,

37:25.660 --> 37:26.770
please consider this as a promise

37:26.770 --> 37:28.290
I make to Song Yimeng.

37:28.630 --> 37:30.690
No matter what she does in the future,

37:30.880 --> 37:32.230
it will not affect the Song family.

37:32.230 --> 37:33.510
You're being ridiculous!

37:33.510 --> 37:35.080
You're the noble crown prince,

37:35.080 --> 37:37.810
yet your mind is filled with nothing
but romance.

37:37.960 --> 37:40.360
How dare you say you have
no selfish motives?

37:40.360 --> 37:41.880
For the sake of a woman,

37:41.960 --> 37:43.630
you've actually gone to such lengths,

37:43.630 --> 37:44.630
even coming to request

37:44.630 --> 37:46.320
an official position for her father.

37:46.320 --> 37:47.120
Your Majesty.

37:47.960 --> 37:48.880
Mr. Song

37:49.190 --> 37:51.030
is truly a pillar of the state

37:51.150 --> 37:53.480
and worthy of the position of Chancellor.

37:54.190 --> 37:56.050
I earnestly request Your Majesty

37:56.070 --> 37:57.200
to grant my request.

38:02.710 --> 38:03.630
I've heard you.

38:06.760 --> 38:07.720
Get lost.

38:13.120 --> 38:14.520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

38:29.800 --> 38:32.130
[In Memory of Our Roots]

38:32.230 --> 38:35.380
[In memory of the late Duchess of Anping,
Wang Nianmei]

38:41.360 --> 38:42.170
Father.

38:42.670 --> 38:44.870
I rushed back as soon as I heard the news.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.560
Why are you hiding over here?

38:51.840 --> 38:53.110
Is this

38:53.710 --> 38:56.510
the imperial edict appointing you
as Chancellor?

38:58.470 --> 39:00.930
[With deeds known at home and afar,
loyal and steadfast, pillar of the court]

38:58.470 --> 39:00.930
[Left Vice Minister of the Imperial
Secretariat & Minister of War, Song Yude]

38:59.150 --> 39:01.590
His Highness entered the palace today,

39:01.920 --> 39:04.380
and besides recommending me as Chancellor,

39:04.920 --> 39:07.580
he also persuaded His Majesty
to issue an edict,

39:07.840 --> 39:09.240
granting the Song family

39:09.480 --> 39:11.410
the Imperial Pardon Certificate.

39:13.550 --> 39:15.150
The Imperial Pardon Certificate?

39:15.150 --> 39:15.960
Is it

39:15.960 --> 39:17.800
the Death-Exemption Plate?

39:18.000 --> 39:18.880
That's right.

39:19.710 --> 39:21.510
When the Crown Prince ascends the throne,

39:21.510 --> 39:24.170
no matter how
the political situation changes,

39:24.630 --> 39:26.190
and whether your relationship
with him

39:26.190 --> 39:27.510
is good or bad,

39:28.670 --> 39:30.200
everyone in the Song family

39:30.510 --> 39:32.370
can be spared from execution.

39:34.510 --> 39:35.960
This royal favor

39:36.770 --> 39:38.510
has never been granted to any noble family

39:38.510 --> 39:40.570
since the founding of the Great Jing.

39:45.710 --> 39:46.630
Yimeng.

39:47.880 --> 39:48.710
For the sake of what you call

39:48.710 --> 39:50.710
a nonexistent future,

39:51.840 --> 39:54.670
Nan Heng has gone to such lengths.

39:55.190 --> 39:57.760
It clearly shows his feelings for you.

40:00.480 --> 40:02.320
Regarding your marriage,

40:02.320 --> 40:03.630
you've been reluctant to agree.

40:03.630 --> 40:05.550
What exactly are you afraid of?

40:10.710 --> 40:11.710
Perhaps

40:12.760 --> 40:14.280
I'm afraid of

40:15.710 --> 40:17.000
an unknown ending.

40:18.340 --> 40:20.290
Fate is in our own hands.

40:20.760 --> 40:22.400
Why fear something

40:22.400 --> 40:24.130
that hasn't even happened yet?

40:30.000 --> 40:30.970
Indeed.

40:32.550 --> 40:34.410
I'm worried Nan Heng will hurt me,

40:35.360 --> 40:37.490
but I'm also worried I'll let him down.

40:39.150 --> 40:41.210
Because I don't belong in this world.

40:41.800 --> 40:42.830
What if...

40:43.630 --> 40:45.960
What if one day, I have
to leave this place?

40:45.960 --> 40:47.560
What should Nan Heng do then?

40:51.230 --> 40:52.210
I've

40:53.110 --> 40:55.400
never been a brave man,

40:56.190 --> 40:59.230
but falling in love with your mother
from humble origins,

40:59.230 --> 41:01.190
marrying her, and having you

41:01.960 --> 41:04.270
were the bravest things I've ever done.

41:09.030 --> 41:09.670
Father.

41:10.840 --> 41:12.710
I think this is the first time

41:13.400 --> 41:15.660
you've ever talked to me about my mother.

41:22.150 --> 41:24.320
Your mother passed away

41:24.320 --> 41:26.320
just days after giving birth to you.

41:28.760 --> 41:30.830
Not being able to grow old with her

41:33.880 --> 41:35.550
is my greatest regret.

41:38.590 --> 41:41.230
But the time I spent with your mother

41:42.670 --> 41:45.670
was also the most beautiful time
of my life.

41:56.110 --> 41:56.920
Yimeng.

41:58.070 --> 42:00.000
Love in this world isn't always

42:00.590 --> 42:02.360
about seeking perfection.

42:03.960 --> 42:05.290
In matters of the heart,

42:05.400 --> 42:06.840
regret hurts more than

42:07.320 --> 42:10.670
not being able
to spend a lifetime together.

42:12.030 --> 42:13.030
I'm sure Nan Heng

42:13.960 --> 42:16.440
feels the same way.
